-person-lt.html">RelatedPersonLt(0.3.0)</a> | <a href="StructureDefinition-patient-lt.html">PatientLt(0.3.0)</a> | <a href="StructureDefinition-care-team-lt.html">CareTeamLt(0.3.0)</a> | <a href="StructureDefinition-healthcare-service-lt.html">HealthcareServiceLt(0.3.0)</a>)</td><td style="vertical-align: top; text-align : var(--ig-left,left); background-color: #F7F7F7; border: 0px #F0F0F0 solid; padding:0px 4px 0px 4px" class="hierarchy"><span style="opacity: 0.5">Who performed the series</span></td></tr>
